data: {"id": "a5849edc7a9448ba-thinking-parallel_evidence-599", "run_id": "a5849edc7a9448ba", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据现有工具结果，已采集以下证据：\n\n**支持 Terminating 状态的事实（因果链完整）：**\n1. **终调机制触发**：Pod 设置了自定义 `finalizers: aiops.lab/hold`，这阻止了 K8s 自动删除。\n2. **容器进程被杀**：容器在 `kubectl_describe` 中显示 `Exit Code: 137`，表明进程收到了 `SIGKILL` (128+9)，说明容器确实无法正常退出或已被强杀。\n3. **节点侧操作已执行**：Events 记录了 40 分钟前 kubelet 发出的 `Normal Killing: Stopping container app`。\n4. **时间线匹配**：创建仅 4 秒后即触发删除（23:09:42 -> 23:09:46），且终止状态已持续约 40 分钟。\n\n**冲突/缺口：**\n1. **日志缺失**：现有上下文未包含该 Pod 的容器日志（`kubectl_logs` 未调用或结果为空/未展示）。为了排除“进程因自身逻辑阻塞而未能处理 SIGTERM 最终导致 SIGKILL 后退出”的可能性", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788825075604, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "a5849edc7a9448ba-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "a5849edc7a9448ba", "seq": 600, "ts_ms": 1788825083276, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 68.048, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-11", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/a5849edc7a9448ba-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "84fa6c1fae9a088befc0f3fc2fef0a7da5f7510a906dd4f2edd0ab3bcbae6aff", "bytes": 2418}, "snapshot_sha256": "36233324351ab74086c0d99734dfaed73a687371d5937319182895d3948401f3"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

