data: {"id": "a5849edc7a9448ba-final", "run_id": "a5849edc7a9448ba", "seq": 604, "ts_ms": 1788825094713, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod workload 持续处于 Terminating 状态达 40 分钟未释放 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-11/workload` 状态: `Terminating (lasts 40m)` | 确证 Pod 处于卡死状态且持续 40 分钟未释放 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod Condition `ContainersReady/Ready`: `False` (原因: `ContainersNotReady`, 消息: `containers with unready status: [app]`) | 说明容器并未健康退出，而是卡在了不可用状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container `app` 终止原因: `Error`, 退出码: `137` | 表明应用进程在生命周期末期遭遇硬停止 (SIGKILL)，而非正常退出 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 异常事件: `Killing  40m  kubelet  Stopping container app` | 证明 kubelet 在 40 分钟前已尝试停止容器，但 Pod 未结束 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 内存资源限制 (`resource_limit.memory`): `96Mi` | 提供容器资源约束上下文 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (app): `0` | 确认无重启行为，排除了因 OOM 等引发的重启循环可能 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nPod 状态停滞与容器实际退出行为存在矛盾：退出码 137 (SIGKILL) 通常意味着进程结束，但容器在 40 分钟前被 Kubelet 杀止后，Pod 的 `ContainersReady` 和 `Ready` 状态仍保持 `False` 且 Pod 未回收。结合日志（Logging）和跟踪（Tracing）数据缺失，目前只能观察到 Pod 在 Termination 阶段被“挂起”，无法获取更深层的退出前堆栈信息。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 定义 finalizer: aiops.lab/hold → 资源清理逻辑阻塞（依赖外部资源不可达） → Finalizer 无法移除 → Pod 持续 Terminating 无法回收\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：Finalizer 清理逻辑阻塞导致 Pod 无法退出。**\n\n该结论基于以下证据支撑：\n1.  **现象确证**：Pod 处于 `Terminating` 状态长达 40 分钟（证据 1），且 `kubelet` 已尝试停止容器（证据 4）。\n2.  **机制矛盾**：容器实际收到了 `SIGKILL`（退出码 137，证据 3），按 K8s 正常逻辑应进入 `Terminated` 并最终完成删除。\n3.  **阻塞点定位**：当容器进程已终止，但 Pod 仍处于 `Terminating` 且无法释放资源时，典型原因为 Pod 资源定义中存在自定义 `finalizer`（如 `aiops.lab/hold`），且其关联的外部依赖清理逻辑失败或阻塞。\n\n**证据不足之处：**\n当前缺乏日志（Logging）和追踪（Tracing）数据来验证应用层是否明确上报了与 `aiops.lab/hold` 相关的清理报错。因此，最终根因被标记为“资源清理依赖（如外部锁或配置项）缺失或不可达”（基于 `unknowns` 中的依赖描述），具体是哪类外部资源或为何不可达需补充应用日志确认。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 68.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 68.0s (Evidence 60.4s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 91.948, "metrics": {"run_id": "a5849edc7a9448ba", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 91.9554808139801, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 91955.4808139801, "llm_calls": 21, "llm_duration_ms": 85617.96426773071, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 7, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 14416.514158248901, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5888.419389724731}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 12458.569526672363, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 68048.40636253357, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11427.972555160522, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

